  prefabStrategy: Dedicated elite duel prefab using Spikarian plus two-handed laser
    gun for phase pressure.
  animationRead: Two-handed laser-gun clips are promoted for aim, shot, crouch reposition,
    phase signal, hit, and death reads. Two-handed laser-gun common humanoid set
    with crouch/retreat and elite phase signal states.
  vfxRead: GuardBreak, ElitePhaseSwap, and EliteArmorBreak cues separate phase tells
    from damage windows.
  reuseJustification: Candidate keeps role behavior in data so the same pattern/deck
    contract can be reused by future summon AI.
